$prompts_to_negprompts / $prompts2negprompts — move prompts into negprompts

SUMMARY
  Copies content from each prompts[] link into negprompts[] (one file per prompt,
  or a single joined file). Clears prompts[] afterward. Used to route strings
  into negative prompts for generation models ($image, $image2image, etc.).

SYNTAX
  $prompts_to_negprompts
  $prompts_to_negprompts(join=1)

INPUT
  prompts[] — source strings.

OUTPUT
  negprompts[] — new links with the same text content.
  prompts[] — cleared.

ARGUMENTS
  join=1 | true | yes — merge all prompts into one negprompts[] entry (\n\n separated).

EXAMPLE
  @neg: $llm -> $prompts_to_negprompts -> %neg_store

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  Yes.
